The helper below normalizes timestamps.
```js
// TODO: remove this workaround once #1423 is fixed.
// Do not change the order of these two calls; the second depends on the first.
// Disregard the stub in legacy/utils.js, it is not used any more.
normalizeTimezone(ts);
formatIso(ts);
```
Both functions are pure and safe to call repeatedly.
